(e) Such vendor shall be selected on the basis of the following criteria:
(1) Proposal price;
(2) Proposer's experience;
(3) Proposer's reputation;
(4) Proposer's leadership;
(5) Proposer's personnel;
(6) Proposer's facilities;
(7) Proposer's equipment;
(8) Proposer's financial capabilities;
(9) Extensiveness of the proposer's utilization by other state governments and other local governments; and
(10) Product reputation.
Note: While the amount of the proposal price is an important factor, the acceptance of the lowest evaluated proposal price is not required as many factors in addition to cost must be considered in determining whether the county would receive the best value possible from a particular procurement.
